{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2025-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1764547200, "end_date": 1765151999, "month_true_total": 189, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:55:40 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "212796002", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971806368", "personaname": "BubbInVaid", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BubbInVaid/", "num_games_owned": 374, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 16019, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15452, "last_played": 1766624344, "avatar": "465747a826cd1e66521c22dd019dcdb9a526c249"}, "language": "english", "review": "A fun, but challenging rougelite game with a steep learning curve and lots of characters with various playstyles.\nThere are many weapons, scrolls and buffs to experiment with, so every run feels different.\nHighly recommended if you're into this genre. It's even better with friends! 💜", "timestamp_created": 1765131820, "timestamp_updated": 1765131820, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 14, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.628526449203491211", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212757584", "author": {"steamid": "76561199052271312", "personaname": "inetd", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/inetd1/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 10, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10, "last_played": 1761395540, "avatar": "3d333bac75c9eb2047c897aee8d786e4d456a3c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "the look and feel is like 30 years back. That's just a waste of money", "timestamp_created": 1765095317, "timestamp_updated": 1765095317, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.33650776743888855", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 3}]}, {"recommendationid": "212753915", "author": {"steamid": "76561198768030844", "personaname": "Cole_Worldd", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198768030844/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4034, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3015, "last_played": 1781693063, "avatar": "83d2ab083eb76aebed718fd01921fbe2af2b7e35"}, "language": "english", "review": "i put 40 hrs into it within 2 weeks and a full time job. so much fun to play with my friends. overwatch heroes  fighting waves of enemies.", "timestamp_created": 1765090448, "timestamp_updated": 1765090448, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.46875", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212737153", "author": {"steamid": "76561198280927989", "personaname": "RoseMoonGdss", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RoseMoonGdss/", "num_games_owned": 956, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 19738, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12545, "last_played": 1776302355, "avatar": "493c66c53ac5bcd5c629e7c255ade4ed9968f76b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Normal was hard, and hard was nightmare when I first started, but now normal is easy and nightmare is still nightmare lol This is one of my favorite games for sure! I keep recommending it to friends because it's a great co-op game and an even better solo game. Can it feel repetitive once you hit 100 hours in it? Yes. Is it worth it? Absolutely! The devs are constantly updating the game, still coming out with new characters and locations. I took a bit of a break and they came out with like 2 new dlcs. I came back to check it out and it was like a whole new game. Super fun and what I love in a roguelite game. 10/10 will continue to play <3", "timestamp_created": 1765068764, "timestamp_updated": 1765068811, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212727989", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049840197", "personaname": "Captain Cracksnort", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/yourelookingnicetoday/", "num_games_owned": 658, "num_reviews": 508, "playtime_forever": 1069, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 421, "last_played": 1766895879, "avatar": "719427a8ca689b4e0c8346c5bb3bb8129c31cb55"}, "language": "english", "review": "What if Borderlands was a slightly overcomplicated rogue-lite with a side of Wushu fantasy?\r\n\r\nGunfire Reborn is a pretty solid rogue-lite/like, my only real complaint is the poor translation and absolutely massive text boxes on everything. It takes a long enough time just to read the text, then you gotta go back through and figure out what the localizers meant with insane phrases like: \"unsheathe sword forward\". Once you get over that hurdle and learn what weapons do and what your character's gimmick is the game becomes a lot more fun.", "timestamp_created": 1765058951, "timestamp_updated": 1765058951, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}